menu "DDJ firmware health"

config DDJ_OTA_FORCE_ROLLBACK_TEST
    bool "Build an intentionally non-confirming OTA rollback test image"
    default n
    help
        Test-only fault injection. When an OTA image first boots in
        PENDING_VERIFY state, restart before marking it valid so the ESP-IDF
        bootloader must roll back to the prior valid slot. Keep this disabled
        for every production and packaged release image.

config DDJ_OTA_STARTUP_TIMEOUT_TEST
    bool "Hold pending P4 startup readiness false until its deadline"
    default n
    depends on !DDJ_OTA_FORCE_ROLLBACK_TEST
    help
        Test-only fault injection for the JC4880 pending-image startup gate.
        Keep network readiness false for the gate while leaving the real AP
        and API available for observation. The normal 60-second deadline must
        reject the pending image. Keep disabled for all ordinary release builds.

endmenu
